WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.080
[upbeat music]

2
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.880
Welcome to this module on
the future of chiplets.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.580
As semiconductor technology evolves,

4
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.900
chiplet-based architectures are
unlocking new levels of scalability,

5
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.100
efficiency, and flexibility.

6
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.400
Let's explore the growing
impact of chiplets.

7
00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:23.300
One of the biggest benefits of chiplets
is improved manufacturability.

8
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:28.400
By using smaller chiplets instead
of a single large monolithic die,

9
00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:33.700
manufacturers can achieve higher
production yields, reducing overall costs.

10
00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:38.420
They also allow for
a design cost advantage,

11
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.660
enabling flexible product design.

12
00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:45.740
Companies can reuse proven chiplets
to create customized solutions,

13
00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:49.600
allowing faster product development
and reducing design risks.

14
00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:53.140
And use of chiplets built
on older process nodes,

15
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:57.060
for example, non-core
functions, also lowers costs,

16
00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:01.280
and in turn improves the economics
of the whole package system.

17
00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:05.970
Finally, chiplets speed up time to market

18
00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.960
and unlock the possibilities
of early market entry.

19
00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:13.720
Chiplet technology is also driving
major advancements in packaging.

20
00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:19.420
3D stacking is largely a function
of the through-silicon via, or TSV pitch.

21
00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:23.550
The future of 3D stacking
includes many possibilities,

22
00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:27.660
from full die-on-die to IP-on-IP,

23
00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:32.580
macro-on-macro, IP folding
and splitting, and circuit slicing.

24
00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.970
Let's continue our journey into
the future of chiplet technology

25
00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:40.480
and explore how disaggregation
is enabling marketplaces.

26
00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:45.840
[upbeat music]

